    "description": "Dokumentasi & Koleksi API Postman untuk project Creator Content & Pipeline Tracker (Task for Junior Programmer).\n\nFitur Utama:\n- Autentikasi (Register, Login dengan JWT)\n- Channel Management (YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, LinkedIn)\n- Content Pipeline & CRUD (Idea -> Scripting -> Recording -> Editing -> Ready -> Published)\n- Production Checklists (Add, Toggle, Delete)\n- Performance Metrics (Views, Likes, Comments, Shares snapshot)",
